{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415735","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415735","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1041573501:1":{"text":"糟了，你的水杯，飞出屋外了！不会落到空境森林里了吧……","source_cn":"糟了，你的水杯，飞出屋外了！不会落到空境森林里了吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4C016BA44A07AE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041573502:1":{"text":"它是……自己飞起来的？","source_cn":"它是……自己飞起来的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97656E2BF3992CE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041573503:1":{"text":"我本来只是想用微风术把里面的热茶吹凉，但我的魔法总会突然异变……真是对不起……","source_cn":"我本来只是想用微风术把里面的热茶吹凉，但我的魔法总会突...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6949A750559D726","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041573504:1":{"text":"不会，你真厉害。","source_cn":"不会，你真厉害。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB104C11091C7EFDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041573505:1":{"text":"我也试过让奇奇飞起来，像风筝那样……可惜飞不了太远。","source_cn":"我也试过让奇奇飞起来，像风筝那样……可惜飞不了太远。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6BD57068F8F412B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041573506:1":{"text":"……奇奇？唔，我的啮齿类朋友们会叫我皮皮，难道奇奇也是某种啮齿类动物？","source_cn":"……奇奇？唔，我的啮齿类朋友们会叫我皮皮，难道奇奇也是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD064017D4D952230","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041573507:1":{"text":"奇奇是我的玩偶。","source_cn":"奇奇是我的玩偶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F4E476A759B56FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041573508:1":{"text":"它是妈妈送给我的，是我最好的朋友。","source_cn":"它是妈妈送给我的，是我最好的朋友。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE909FCA6667BC728","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041573509:1":{"text":"呃，虽然没有很明白，但你要是不嫌我麻烦……","source_cn":"呃，虽然没有很明白，但你要是不嫌我麻烦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE31604B936E059F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041573510:1":{"text":"就、就比如前几天，我不小心把商业街上所有的玩偶鼻子都变成了彩色……","source_cn":"就、就比如前几天，我不小心把商业街上所有的玩偶鼻子都变...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F191A326C1EB94C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041573511:1":{"text":"虽然老板夸我为他们节省了上色的时间……","source_cn":"虽然老板夸我为他们节省了上色的时间……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB6B9871FC